  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Union assistance to address top priority health-related preparedness and response efforts of Uzbekistan to combat COVID-19 outbreak</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this action is to mitigate the impact of COVID-19 in Uzbekistan.Its objective will be achieved through the: 1) mobilisation of an effective, rapid, and coordinated response to COVID-19 with a particular focus on providing personal protective equipment to health and first-line workers in healthcare facilities.</narrative>
  </description>
